WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.756
Bulk fee operations

00:00:05.806 --> 00:00:09.125
Open Finance, then Collect Payments.

00:00:14.102 --> 00:00:19.796
Tick the box in the table header to select every student, or tick students one by one.

00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:25.739
In the bar at the bottom, choose the account that receives the money.

00:00:26.201 --> 00:00:35.158
Press Pay Full. Every selected student is marked fully paid at once. The bar also lets you delete the selected records.

00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:43.966
All paid in one step
